00:10:26,768 --> 00:10:33,328
对于最佳实践、模式或者如何实现某些功能，真的没必要用 MCP，因为技能（技能）就能搞定。
There is really no reason to use an MCP for things like best practices, patterns,
or how to implement something because the skill can handle that.

