232
00:12:38,128 --> 00:12:41,888
我不能随便花掉价值一百万美元的 Token，大公司也不行。
I can't just spend a million dollars worth of tokens, and neither can big companies.

233
00:12:42,048 --> 00:12:49,088
你们中的很多人可能和我一样用的是 20 美元的套餐，或
者也许你是这里的土豪，用的是一百或两百美元的套餐。
A lot of you are probably on the $20 plan like me, or maybe you're Mr.
Big Bucks over here with a hundred dollar or two hundred dollar plan.

234
00:12:49,248 --> 00:12:51,728
无论哪种情况，上下文管理对你们所有人都很重要。
Either way, context management matters for all of you.

235
00:12:51,918 --> 00:12:54,276
你看，Claude 是根据 Token 来追踪使用的。
You see, Claude tracks usage based on tokens.

236
00:12:54,448 --> 00:12:56,288
它不是根据你发送了多少次提示词来计算的。
It's not based on how many prompts you send.

237
00:12:56,448 --> 00:12:59,808
你发送的每一条消息，Claude 读取的每个文件，它写的每一个回复。
Every message you send, every file Claude reads, every response it writes.

238
00:13:00,224 --> 00:13:00,864
都会产生 Token。
Generates tokens.

239
00:13:00,974 --> 00:13:10,180
这里的目标是让这些 Token 发挥最大效用，并尽可能持久，这既是为了你的使用限制，
也是为了 Claude 的性能，因为 Claude 的上下文窗口也依赖这些 Token。
The goal here is to make these tokens effective and last long for both your usage limits and Claude's performance because Claude has a
context window that also relies on these tokens.

240
00:13:10,414 --> 00:13:12,144
